            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haciye ikindi gihe kirekire, umwami wa Egiputa arapfa. Abisirayeli batakambishwa n’imibabaro y’ubuja barimwo, bararira, maze ugutaka kwabo kuraduga gushikira Imana. ",
